  "content": "<p><strong>Fullbright UB 资源包</strong> 无需火把，点亮黑暗！本资源包可为Minecraft带来最大亮度，兼容原版、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a>（需搭配<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpolytone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PolyTone</a>）以及<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a>。</p><p><strong>1.21.6</strong><br>\nSodium 1.21.6版本需要额外安装一个类似Polytone的小型模组。您只需将其拖入资源包文件夹，即可正常使用。</p><p><em>功能特性：</em></p><ul>\n<li><strong>全亮度</strong>：无论洞穴还是夜晚，始终清晰可见。</li>\n<li><strong>兼容性与高性能</strong>：与原版、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a>及<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a>（需<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpolytone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PolyTone</a>）流畅运行。</li>\n<li><strong>安装简单</strong>：将文件拖入资源包目录，在游戏中激活即可。</li>\n</ul><p><em>总结：</em> 适合所有希望以更明亮、清晰的方式体验Minecraft的玩家——无需模组或光影包。</p><p>⚠️ <strong>需要帮助？请查阅文档！</strong><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblog.worldresourcepack.com%252fblog%252ffullbright-faq%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文档/常见问题</a></p><p>如果您在安装或使用Fullbright资源包时遇到困难，欢迎查阅此文档。其中包含分步安装指南以及最大化利用资源包的技巧。如有更多疑问，请随时联系我们的社区或<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fworldresourcepack.com%252fsupport%252fcontact-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">支持团队</a>。我们很乐意为您提供帮助，确保您获得最佳Minecraft体验。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fworldresourcepack.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://worldresourcepack.com/assets/image-wrp.png\" alt=\"wrp\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffullbright-ub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://worldresourcepack.com/assets/image2.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a></p>",
